    "cards":  [
                  {
                      "dot":  "cyan",
                      "title":  "Verified scope",
                      "items":  [
                                    "PosFront is Angular 22 with standalone bootstrap, lazy routes, RxJS and NgRx SignalStore.",
                                    "Dashboard, products, inventory, sales, customers and reports use a shared workspace component; checkout has a dedicated page.",
                                    "The diagram describes the inspected working tree. Source files are modified or untracked, so Git commit provenance is intentionally omitted."
                                ]
                  },
                  {
                      "dot":  "emerald",
                      "title":  "Cash sale workflow",
                      "items":  [
                                    "Barcode / text lookup selects active seeded products; cart state snapshots item data and computes subtotal, tax and total.",
                                    "The page validates cash tender; CheckoutStore calls MockCheckoutService, prepends the sale in SalesStore, clears the cart and exposes the receipt.",
                                    "Payment is local demo behavior. Card gateway reports no terminal, and cash sale recording does not call a payment processor."
                                ]
                  },
                  {
                      "dot":  "amber",
                      "title":  "Data and persistence",
                      "items":  [
                                    "Product, cart, inventory and sale data live in NgRx SignalStore state initialized from source fixtures; changes last only in the current app session.",
                                    "No backend project, controller, database entity/repository, browser storage, durable queue or sync path was found in PosFront.",
                                    "OfflineSyncService is an extension point with isImplemented=false. The configured API URL is not evidence of a running server; ApiService has no feature callers."
                                ]
                  },
                  {
                      "dot":  "rose",
                      "title":  "Architecture concerns",
                      "items":  [
                                    "AuthStore starts with a hard-coded authenticated cashier and null token; guards are client-side demo gates, not server authorization.",
                                    "Only products and inventory routes are guarded; checkout and other workspace routes have no route guard in their route definitions.",
                                    "WorkspacePage owns dashboard, catalog, inventory, sales, customer and report behavior in one large component, overlapping checkout operations.",
                                    "No durable transaction boundary or authoritative inventory update exists; completed mock sales do not decrement stock."
                                ]
                  },
                  {
                      "dot":  "slate",
                      "title":  "Working-tree evidence (not commit-bound)",
